{
  "_comment": [
    "Fixed rosters for the 2026-fall league (Aug 1 -- Dec 31, 2026).",
    "",
    "Roster fields (per player):",
    "  name    -- CANONICAL display_name (matches Steam scoreboard). Used for",
    "             team inference on ingested screenshots and for individual stats.",
    "  role    -- 'core' | 'support' | 'stand_in'. 5 non-stand_in per team.",
    "  aka     -- friendly nicknames used by !register so players don't have to",
    "             know the canonical Steam name ('Cpx' -> 'Mandark [<MC>]').",
    "             The Teams tab DISPLAYS aka[0] with the canonical underneath,",
    "             so the sheet's nickname is what people actually read.",
    "  backup  -- optional. Canonical name of the stand-in who can substitute",
    "             FOR THIS SLOT, or a LIST of them. Slots without `backup`",
    "             can't be filled by anyone -- the primary must play.",
    "",
    "2026-08-07 roster refresh, from the captains' sheet. Four changes:",
    "",
    "  1. UT and samundar khan SWAPPED TEAMS. UT is now Team 2 core;",
    "     samundar khan ('XXX') is now Team 1 core, backed by TigerX.",
    "  2. MODE:IG.BASHIRA moved from Team 3 support to Team 4 support.",
    "     Confirmed independently by the first league screenshot, where he",
    "     played for Team 4 ('Frantic Fan Boys').",
    "  3. Beast Mode is now a Team 3 SUPPORT STARTER, not the stand-in.",
    "     Tiger-Y backs that slot.",
    "  4. Khuni Billa dropped from Team 4 support to a stand-in backing",
    "     beetlebum's slot. Asta takes the support seat.",
    "",
    "Two long-unknown players were identified on 2026-08-07 and are now",
    "canonical Steam names rather than sheet nicknames -- both already had",
    "a long record in the ledger under those names:",
    "",
    "  Shami -> 'HypermodeL [M.C]'   (17 games, also called 'sesto')",
    "  Asta  -> \"I'M Still Noob\"     (20 games)",
    "",
    "Without this, both would have kept minting a second identity every",
    "time they appeared, and neither could ever be attached to a series.",
    "",
    "STILL UNIDENTIFIED: Team 2's 'Oden jr' has never appeared on any",
    "scoreboard, so his Steam name is unknown. A game he plays in cannot",
    "be attached to a series until someone says which name is his.",
    "",
    "Theekra, Tiger-Y, Gillu and Soooze were on the sheet but in no roster,",
    "so they could neither register nor be fielded. They are now stand-ins",
    "on the teams that list them. None has played a recorded game yet.",
    "",
    "open_pool: players who registered via `!register` in Discord but aren't",
    "on any team's fixed roster. Captains can pull from the pool for stand-ins.",
    "The pool is written by tools/discord_league.py, never by hand."
  ],
